# Evidence and source of truth

- Classify material claims: VERIFIED, CLIENT_REPORTED, OBSERVED, INFERRED, HYPOTHESIS, ASSUMPTION, CONTRADICTED, UNKNOWN.
- Do not promote client-reported statements to verified facts without evidence.
- Resolve or explicitly leave open conflicts (`EvidenceConflict`).
- Identify authoritative system of record before recommending automation or AI.
- Review Packet is evidence-only; sold Blueprint is separate and James-approved.
- Never log questionnaire bodies, tokens, or secrets into monitors.

See `owner-ops/docs/peacemakers-operating-system/EVIDENCE_STANDARD.md`.
